Z||000000||Dan86gt3.8||04-11-2000||11:21 AM||||Well my first question is do you know when the grand prix of the us is going to be, I caught the end of brazil, and last weeks that was in san something or other in Italy.  I have missed last season all together cause we could never find it on tv, but it looks like fox sports has it now.  But man what a jumpin technology, half of thier cars are carbon fibers, and they have heads up Displays INSIDE THIER HELMETS.  It also looks like the f1 officials make them run treaded tires to slow them down.... man what will thoose guys think of next?||||reg||1
Z||000001||Cliff Pennock||04-11-2000||11:37 AM||||I looooove Formula One racing! Ofcourse, that's partly because there's a Dutch driver also (Jos Verstappen). I also like F1 because of its technology. It's true that these cars are truly wonders of technology. I like Indy Cart also, but for totally different reasons. Indy Cart is more endurance in my opinion. F1 is all about speed, speed and more speed. A typical pitstop takes 7-8 seconds. That's for refueling and changing 4 wheels! It's true the tires have grooves to slow the car down.<P>I'm not sure where you heared F1 drivers have HUDs in their helmets because that's simply not true.||||reg||14
Z||000002||bHooper||04-11-2000||01:25 PM||||Heck, I'm probably the only native North Carolinian member of the "Tifosy"!... I'm probably the only one that knows what it is! <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>I have spent most of my 33 years in nascar country, and can't stand it!  I have every F1 race from mid-84 to mid 99 on video tape!  Is that crazy?  <P>The technology is wonderfull, the speed is great and the cars are awsome!  I will defend F1 to the end of my days, people that only watch nascar do not understand why we find it interesting... "why do you have to wait so long to see a car?"  "there ain't no passin"  are the common arguments that I hear.<P>I like CART, also, but besides F1, sportscar racing is my second favorite form of auto racing.<P>Sorry for the long windedness  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif"><P>hoop||||reg||1
Z||000003||bHooper||04-11-2000||01:28 PM||||Oh yea, I almost forgot... the US Gran Prix is in Indy from September 22-24.<P>I will be sitting in turn one... all grins  <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/forum/biggrin.gif">||||reg||1
